-- ============================================================================
-- v1373: Seed / sample data — Testing & Assurance registers (v1372) for the demo project
-- ============================================================================
-- Owner request 2026-11-09: sample data where it was missing — 10 records each for UAT, Regression
-- Testing, Performance Testing, Security Testing, DR Testing and Operational Readiness Testing, and one
-- complete Dress Rehearsal Strategy document (one strategy per project), for SEED334-PRJ-08 (fictional
-- "Northbridge Bank" core banking replacement). Dated around today (9 Nov 2026) and consistent with the
-- Testing Strategy, SIT and Sanity Checks samples: completed runs in Oct–Nov 2026 carry results, defects
-- / findings and sign-off; running ones partial results; planned ones scope and plans only.
-- Vendor-neutral (rule 26); person fields are plain text. display_id = '' so Admin ID Generation assigns
-- it (rule 16.2). Fixed hex-only ids …-4000-b018- … b01d- and b041- (ranges checked free before use);
-- ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING; nothing inserted if the project is missing. The final query counts the
-- records per register, so a skipped insert is visible.
-- Prerequisites: v1372. Idempotent.
-- ============================================================================

